---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' https://github.com/plantuml/plantuml/pull/2989
' Same diagram as nonreg.svg.EntryExitPointStemTest (edges_from_outside_meet_entry_and_exit_points_from_outside_and_clear_of_their_labels).
' Vega forces Smetana, which has no orthogonal routing: this file does not run
' the ortho stem rewrite, it guards that Smetana output is left unchanged.
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node
hide empty description
state Session {
  state "card" as epCard <<entryPoint>>
  state "app" as epApp <<entryPoint>>
  state "done" as xpDone <<exitPoint>>
  state "aborted" as xpAbort <<exitPoint>>
  epCard --> Reading
  epApp --> Validating
  Reading --> Validating : cardRead
  Validating --> Charging : accepted
  Validating --> xpAbort : refused
  Charging --> xpDone : full
  Charging --> xpAbort : unplugged
}
Idle --> epCard : cardTapped
Idle --> epApp : appStart
xpDone --> Idle
xpAbort --> Idle : / showError()
@enduml
